    <string name="terms_title">Terms of use</string>
    <string name="terms_body">PhoShare lives on this device and nowhere else. There\'s no server, no cloud and no internet permission: your photos, comments and favorites never leave the phone unless you share them yourself.\n\nEvery account on this device can see every post on this device. That\'s the point: make another account and you instantly have a friend.\n\nIf you uninstall the app or clear its data, everything is gone for good. Back up what matters.\n\nBe nice to yourself in the comments.</string>

